{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-95-1","title":"Psalms 95:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 An exhortation to praise God, 3 for his greatness; 6 and for his goodness; 8 and not to tempt him.</p>\n<p>Come. 34:3; 66:8; 107:8,15,21; 117:1; 118:1; 136:1-3; 148:11-13; 150:6 sing. 47:6,7; 66:1,2; 81:1; 96:1,2; 101:1; Ex 15:1,21; 1Ch 16:9; Eph 5:19 Col 3:16; Re 5:9; 14:3; 15:3 let us make. 66:1; 98:4-8; 100:1; Ezr 3:11-13; Isa 12:4-6; Jer 33:11; Mt 21:9 Re 19:6 the rock. 89:26; De 32:15; 2Sa 22:47; 1Co 10:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-2","title":"Psalms 95:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Let us. 7:7; 100:2,4; Jer 31:12,13 come before his presence. Heb. prevent his face. 17:13; *marg: psalms. 105:2; Jas 5:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-3","title":"Psalms 95:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>For. 86:8-10; 96:4; 97:9; 145:3; Jer 10:6,7 a great. 47:2; 48:2; Jer 10:10; 46:18; 48:15; Da 4:37; Mal 1:11,14; Mt 5:35 above. 135:5; Ex 18:11; Isa 44:8; Jer 10:10-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-4","title":"Psalms 95:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>In. 21:2; Job 11:10 his. Heb. whose. deep. 135:6 the strength of the hills is his also. or, heights of thehills are his. 65:6; 97:5; Job 9:5; Mic 1:4; Na 1:5; Hab 3:6,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-5","title":"Psalms 95:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>The sea is his. Heb. Whose the sea is. 33:7; Ge 1:9,10; Job 38:10,11; Pr 8:29; Jer 5:22 hands. Pr 8:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-6","title":"Psalms 95:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>O come. 1; Ho 6:1; Mt 4:2; Re 22:17 worship. 72:9; Ex 20:5; Mt 4:9; Mr 14:35; Ac 10:25,26; Re 22:8 kneel. 1Ki 8:54; 2Ch 6:13; Ezr 9:5; Da 6:10; Lu 22:41; Ac 7:60; 20:36; 21:5 Eph 3:14; Php 2:10; 1Co 6:20 our. 100:3; Job 35:10; Ec 12:1; Isa 54:5; Joh 1:3; 1Pe 4:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-7","title":"Psalms 95:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>For he. 48:14; 67:6; 115:3; Ex 15:2; 20:2; Jer 31:33; Heb 11:16 people. 23:1; 79:13; 80:1; 100:3; Isa 40:10,11; Eze 34:30,31; Joh 10:3,4 Joh 10:14-16; Ac 20:28; 1Pe 2:25 To day. Heb 3:7,13,15; 4:7 if ye. Pr 8:6; Isa 55:3; Mt 3:2,3; 17:5; Re 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-8","title":"Psalms 95:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Harden. Ex 8:15; 1Sa 6:6; Da 5:20; Ac 19:9; Ro 2:5; Heb 3:13; 12:25 in the. Ex 17:2,7; Nu 14:11,22,27; 20:13; De 1:34,35; 6:16 Heb 3:8,9,15-19; Jude 1:5 provocation. Heb. contention.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-9","title":"Psalms 95:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>When. 78:17,18,40,41,56; 1Co 10:9 saw. Nu 14:22; Mt 11:20-22; Joh 15:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-10","title":"Psalms 95:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Forty. Nu 14:33,34; 32:13; De 1:3; 2:14-16; Heb 3:9,10,17 grieved. Ge 6:6; Eph 4:30 err. Isa 63:17; Heb 3:10,17 and they. Pr 1:7,22-29; Jer 9:6; Joh 3:19-21; Ro 1:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-95-11","title":"Psalms 95:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":95,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":95,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I sware. Nu 14:23,28-30; De 1:34,35; Heb 3:11,18; 4:3,5 that they should not enter. Heb. if they enter. my rest. Ge 2:2,3; Jer 6:16; Mt 11:28,29; Ho 4:4-11; Re 14:13</p>"}]}